steps:
Carry-over on recompute: only when JSON(layoutParamsOf(old)) equals JSON(new), copy a cell's laid bits when all of these match:
- kind;
- geometry (line Float32 bits, sub k, free polygons);
- every piece's palette hex and materialId.
Compare palette entries, never indices. Expose lastCarryOver {kept, reset, cells}. Workspace shows a one-time notice 'N verlegte Steine übernommen, M haben sich geändert (anzeigen)', or 'Raster geändert – Fortschritt nicht übertragbar' when the layout changed.
